                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                        "entry_id": "a0d3c34a-2a71-3f85-8ab1-e28af6142511",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to a race (or a people)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70ac672e-e930-4e18-bbe6-058c59cf8283",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "the racial complexion"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "390b9e44-a9a2-4ed8-904b-e705d5ddc8c8",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "racial stereotypes"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "246a1bc8-e580-48a3-a6b3-0cff604dfef4",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "racial remarks"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9468e10b-2d3a-4de2-867e-ccc6ae3188bb",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "racial profiling"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20d59078-0114-4c16-83e9-8158bb027d03",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "racial discrimination"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83c64430-7bbe-41c8-b4ca-4b2e87db7d70",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "From a musical point of view, the modern Iberian seems a fac-simile of the mediæval Frenchman. Barring out racial distinctions, they both live in an analogous environment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dec324c-0262-4b6f-8b8d-3bd2bcf3a57f",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "Such extremes have always been characteristic of the barbarous northmen, and we may not be wrong in referring to racial causes for the solution of this problem of contrarieties otherwise inexplicable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5e98520-28f3-4a10-8c36-f8a2b3d2c436",
                                                "sense_id": "4b655314-33eb-3ea4-8af9-c16ced4b516a",
                                                "text": "Coincidentally, support for race-conscious policies, such as affirmative action, financial reparations for slavery, and race-based government assistance, have reached record highs. In fact, by some measures, the racial liberalism of white Democrats and liberals has even surpassed that of their non-white counterparts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
